{"id":"3456061351","kind":"answer","title":"理论上人的大脑可以记忆多少东西？","author":"Jarrett Ye","original_authors":["Jarrett Ye"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2024-04-06","updated":"2024-04-06","votes":134,"comment_count":20,"minutes":4,"chars":1782,"keywords":["间隔重复","检索练习","间隔效应","学习科学","长期记忆"],"summary":"根据 FSRS 算法模拟，一个普通的 Anki 用户，一天记忆 8 个小时，坚持 60 年，大约可以记住 175 万张卡片： 模拟脚本： fsrs4anki/fsrs4anki_simulator.ipynb at main · open-spaced-repetition/fsrs4anki (github.com) 参数…","question_detail_html":"<p>大脑空间是有限的，有效的空间总无法记忆无限的知识吧。只是好奇理论容载量是多少。</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/321524769/answer/3456061351","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"DJ4Z9ZZ2\">根据 FSRS 算法模拟，一个普通的 Anki 用户，一天记忆 8 个小时，坚持 60 年，大约可以记住 175 万张卡片：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-f0c12125197b5ecea71cfcaf720875fb_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-7d1b2aabada91b1ee7c383d6307bbc1f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7d1b2aabada91b1ee7c383d6307bbc1f_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"556\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-f0c12125197b5ecea71cfcaf720875fb_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-7d1b2aabada91b1ee7c383d6307bbc1f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-7d1b2aabada91b1ee7c383d6307bbc1f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"556\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"8PkC_iCQ\">模拟脚本：</p><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://github.com/open-spaced-repetition/fsrs4anki/blob/main/fsrs4anki_simulator.ipynb\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fsrs4anki/fsrs4anki_simulator.ipynb at main · open-spaced-repetition/fsrs4anki (github.com)</a><p data-pid=\"T84amiqq\">参数：</p><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><code class=\"language-python3\"><span class=\"c1\"># parameters for FSRS</span>\n<span class=\"n\">w</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">0.5701</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">1.448</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">4.1396</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">11.0112</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n     <span class=\"mf\">5.1674</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">1.2378</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">0.8798</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">0.0362</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n     <span class=\"mf\">1.629</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">0.1342</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">1.0309</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n     <span class=\"mf\">2.099</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">0.0839</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">0.3204</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">1.5704</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n     <span class=\"mf\">0.219</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">2.8538</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">requestRetention</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mf\">0.82</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># recommended setting: 0.8 ~ 0.9</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># parameters for Anki</span>\n<span class=\"n\">graduatingInterval</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span>\n<span class=\"n\">easyInterval</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">4</span>\n<span class=\"n\">easyBonus</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mf\">1.3</span>\n<span class=\"n\">hardInterval</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mf\">1.2</span>\n<span class=\"n\">intervalModifier</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span>\n<span class=\"n\">newInterval</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n<span class=\"n\">minimumInterval</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span>\n<span class=\"n\">leechThreshold</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">8</span>\n<span class=\"n\">leechSuspend</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">False</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># common parameters</span>\n<span class=\"n\">maximumInterval</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">36500</span>\n<span class=\"n\">new_cards_limits</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">99999</span>\n<span class=\"n\">review_limits</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">99999</span>\n<span class=\"n\">max_time_limts</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">28800</span>\n<span class=\"n\">learn_days</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">21900</span>\n<span class=\"n\">deck_size</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">3000000</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># get the true time from review logs</span>\n<span class=\"n\">filename</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"collection-2022-09-18@13-21-58.colpkg\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># smooth curves</span>\n<span class=\"n\">moving_average_period</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">14</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># Set it to True if you don't want the optimizer to use the review logs from suspended cards.</span>\n<span class=\"n\">filter_out_suspended_cards</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">False</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># Red: 1, Orange: 2, Green: 3, Blue: 4, Pink: 5, Turquoise: 6, Purple: 7</span>\n<span class=\"c1\"># Set it to [1, 2] if you don't want the optimizer to use the review logs from cards with red or orange flag.</span>\n<span class=\"n\">filter_out_flags</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">[]</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">schedulers</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"fsrs\"</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># You can disable anki by removing it from this list</span></code></pre></div><p data-pid=\"1ZgWsC8C\">而 Anki 用户的每张卡片的信息量差不多有这么多：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-b0d88fa5e70a6ef5b5236b898c5e0f9e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-eda982b4ae9d02b3e79ee9334a0075cb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-eda982b4ae9d02b3e79ee9334a0075cb_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1270\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-b0d88fa5e70a6ef5b5236b898c5e0f9e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-eda982b4ae9d02b3e79ee9334a0075cb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-eda982b4ae9d02b3e79ee9334a0075cb_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1270\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"JelDXo3E\">看上去文字量很少，但实际上这些文字背后有很多前置知识，比如前脑、脑干是什么，肾上腺素是什么，基底核又是什么。它们也可以通过编写对应的卡片来学习和记忆。</p><p data-pid=\"YxzYQvqe\">根据诺贝尔奖、图灵奖双料得主 Herbert Simon 的研究<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，一名国际象棋大师大约掌握 5 万个知识组块。假设每个知识组块我们都用 2～3 张卡片来进行记忆编码，那么编写并记忆 10+ 万张卡片就可以成为这个领域的专家。</p><p data-pid=\"0V55_6lN\">如果每个专业领域的知识组块大致相当，那么根据 FSRS 的预测，理论上我们一生中可以通过间隔重复记住十个专业以上的知识。</p><p data-pid=\"YCzZHlLr\">当然，以上只是理论估计，实际上我们还要考虑知识之间的相互联系、知识在不同场景下的迁移表现等等。</p><p data-pid=\"Cd5QSUxy\">更多有关间隔重复和长期记忆的相关研究，请见：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-9268cd1d0435215e42750c7d34ecd7b5_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1203\" data-image-width=\"2183\" data-tm-id=\"420105707\" href=\"#/post/420105707\">Thoughts Memo：(1/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——概述</a><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-508467d2d77b37d7642c84c0a995408a_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"815\" data-image-width=\"1199\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/561539418\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo：间隔重复记忆算法研究资源汇总</a><p></p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> Chase and Simon. \"Perception in Chess\". Cognitive Psychology Volume 4, 1973 </li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"420105707","title":"(1/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——概述","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":310,"minutes":10,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"404257681","title":"间隔重复记忆系统（Spaced repetition memory system）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":88,"minutes":16,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"1907786810685395276","title":"FSRS for Anki 发展史","author":"Jarrett Ye","votes":341,"minutes":32,"reason":"延伸深读 · Jarrett Ye"},{"id":"664758200","title":"Anki 新算法 FSRS 配置指南","author":"Expertium","votes":377,"minutes":8,"reason":"延伸深读 · Expertium"},{"id":"710552897","title":"科学的学习方法综述：哪些行之有效，哪些徒劳无功？","author":"John Dunlosky","votes":424,"minutes":17,"reason":"延伸深读 · John Dunlosky"},{"id":"594732691","title":"使用抽认卡，成为更优秀的程序员：第一部分","author":"Sasha Laundy","votes":55,"minutes":5,"reason":"延伸深读 · Sasha Laundy"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"3174376277","title":"Github上有哪些Rust写的知名项目？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":197,"minutes":15,"reason":"相似问答 · 197 赞同"},{"id":"1291497149","title":"电脑版anki2.1有什么推荐的插件?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":126,"minutes":13,"reason":"相似问答 · 126 赞同"},{"id":"3171853749","title":"哪些 Rust 库让你相见恨晚？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":124,"minutes":8,"reason":"相似问答 · 124 赞同"},{"id":"3523024593","title":"你认为的最科学的学习方法是什么？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":225,"minutes":5,"reason":"相似问答 · 225 赞同"},{"id":"2998286352","title":"想形成长期记忆，或者永久记忆，需要重复记忆多少天并且多少遍呀？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":470,"minutes":9,"reason":"相似问答 · 470 赞同"}]}